@IamEmily2050 Sometimes I confused by the one-prompt approach (and simple one). I feel like with every new model release, people are waiting until the model can read our minds and wow us. 

I think we can already do way more than what we could before. Like you said, it goes back to system architecture and software design. AI is still a tech. 

I ended up making something my own writer's room (just repo with a lot of text 😅) to help me track every story/narrative across all my projects, using Gemini Flash & antigravity.
